## 下に置く
size 16x10 cursor 0,2 block
   |line0           |
   |li┌──────────┐  |
fg |..cccccccccccc..|
   |li│ func f() │  |
fg |..c..........c..|
fx |   vvvvvvvvvv   |
   |li│ ok       │  |
fg |..c..........c..|
fx |   vvvvvvvvvv   |
   |li└──────────┘  |
fg |..cccccccccccc..|
   |line5           |
   |line6           |
   |line7           |
   | NORMA 1,3  All |
fx |SSSSSSSSSSSSSSSS|
   |                |

## 下に収まらなければ上に置く
size 16x10 cursor 6,0 block
   |line0           |
   |line1           |
   |┌───┐           |
fg |ccccc...........|
   |│ a │           |
fg |c...c...........|
fx | vvv            |
   |│ b │           |
fg |c...c...........|
fx | vvv            |
   |└───┘           |
fg |ccccc...........|
   |line6           |
   |line7           |
   | NORMA 7,1  All |
fx |SSSSSSSSSSSSSSSS|
   |                |

## 右の端で左へ寄せる
size 16x10 cursor 1,4 block
   |line0           |
   |line1           |
   |┌──────────────┐|
fg |cccccccccccccccc|
   |│ abcdefghijkl │|
fg |c..............c|
fx | vvvvvvvvvvvvvv |
   |└──────────────┘|
fg |cccccccccccccccc|
   |line5           |
   |line6           |
   |line7           |
   | NORMA 2,5  All |
fx |SSSSSSSSSSSSSSSS|
   |                |

## 見出しは上の枠線に重ねる
size 16x10 cursor 0,0 block
   |line0           |
   |┌─T─┐           |
fg |ccccc...........|
   |│ x │           |
fg |c...c...........|
fx | vvv            |
   |└───┘           |
fg |ccccc...........|
   |line4           |
   |line5           |
   |line6           |
   |line7           |
   | NORMA 1,1  All |
fx |SSSSSSSSSSSSSSSS|
   |                |

